<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_AssaultRifle_T1">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type84_2_</defName>
		<label>Type 84-2</label>
		<description>Caliber: 5.56x45mm NATO. 30-round detachable mag. Select-Fire.
		
The Type 84 is a modification of the Chinese Type 56 AK rifle to fire the 5.56x45 NATO cartridge. Most well known are the semi-auto locked versions to civilians known as the "Type 84S," but select-fire variants for potential (albeit unsuccessful) military contracts are also known to have been produced. 

The Type 84-2 variant features a side folding stock like on the Type 56-2.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>CGF1/Gun/Type84-2</texPath>
			<drawSize>1.01</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers>
				<li>CGF1_MWP_Building_Gunsmith</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisite>CGF1_MWP_Research_T9_SpaceAgeFirearms</researchPrerequisite>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>5</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
		</recipeMaker>
		<costList>
			<Steel>60</Steel>
			<ComponentIndustrial>7</ComponentIndustrial>
		</costList>
		<statBases>
			<WorkToMake>40000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>3.6</Mass>
			<AccuracyTouch>0.60</AccuracyTouch>
			<AccuracyShort>0.60</AccuracyShort>
			<AccuracyMedium>0.55</AccuracyMedium>
			<AccuracyLong>0.50</AccuracyLong>
			<RangedWeapon_Cooldown>1.7</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
		</statBases>
		<equippedAngleOffset>40</equippedAngleOffset>
		<weaponTags>
			<li>CGF1_AR_Civilian</li>
			<li>CGF1_AR_Military</li>
		</weaponTags>
		<tradeTags>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam</li>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam_AR</li>
		</tradeTags>
